<h1>API 文档</h1>
<h2>GET /lookup</h2>
<pre><code>curl "{{viewBaseUrl}}/lookup?ip=8.8.8.8"</code></pre>
<h3>响应</h3>
<pre><code>{
  "ip": "8.8.8.8",
  "country": { "code": "US", "name": "United States", "source": "maxmind" },
  ...
}</code></pre>
<h2>API Key 认证</h2>
<p>登录后在 <a href="/dashboard/keys">控制台</a> 创建 API Key,然后:</p>
<pre><code>curl "{{viewBaseUrl}}/lookup?ip=8.8.8.8&key=ipq_xxxxxxxxxxxx"</code></pre>
<h2>返回格式</h2>
<p>字段缺失时省略;IP 未找到记录返回 404 {error: "not_found"}。</p>
